-- =====================================================================
-- Session 155 — Matt 19 extras-tier cross-references (single chapter)
-- =====================================================================
-- Adds Matt 19's extras-tier rows + threads to the cross-reference
-- corpus. Continues the S131 (Matt 1-2) -> S154 (Matt 17) extras-tier
-- coverage; Matt 19 lands as the divorce-controversy + eunuchs-for-the-
-- kingdom + children-and-the-kingdom + rich-young-ruler-and-keep-the-
-- commandments + camel-eye-of-needle + twelve-thrones-twelve-tribes
-- chapter. Five framework-bearing narrative movements anchor the
-- chapter:
--
--   (a) the geographic-shift from Galil (Galilee) into Yahudah (Judaea)
--       beyond the Yarden (Jordan) (vv.1-2) — the fourth Matthean
--       discourse-close (*when Yahusha (Jesus) had finished these
--       sayings*) and the customary-pilgrimage-route the King takes
--       toward Yerushalayim (Jerusalem), recapitulating the Yahoshua
--       (Joshua)-entry-from-beyond-the-Yarden Tanakh-substance of
--       Joshua 3:14-17; multitudes-following and healing-substance
--       continuing the Isaiah-35 Messianic-credential.
--   (b) the Pharisees''-divorce-question + the King''s-appeal-behind-
--       Mosheh (Moses)-to-the-creation-ordinance + the eunuchs-for-the-
--       kingdom saying (vv.3-12) — the Pharisaic Hillel-vs-Shammai-on-
--       Deuteronomy-24:1 trap refused at the architectural-level; the
--       King appeals BEHIND Mosheh (Moses) TO Bereshit (Genesis) 1-2''s
--       creation-ordinance (*male and female created he them*, *they
--       shall be one flesh*); *from the beginning it was not so* lays
--       the FRAMEWORK-MAJOR architectural-pattern for reading the
--       Torah — the Father''s-will-from-the-beginning behind the
--       Mosaic-concession-to-hardness-of-heart, both substances Torah-
--       preserved per Red Line #4; the same architectural-pattern at
--       Deuteronomy 17:14-20 + 1 Samuel 8:7''s king-concession; the
--       *except-it-be-for-fornication* exception-clause preserves the
--       substantial-sexual-impurity substance of Deuteronomy 22:13-21 +
--       Leviticus 20:10-21 + the divine-precedent of Jeremiah 3:8 where
--       Yahuah (the LORD)-himself puts-away-the-northern-house for
--       substantial-spiritual-adultery; the eunuchs-for-the-kingdom
--       saying recognizes voluntary-celibacy-in-kingdom-service as the
--       gift-substance some-receive (ruling out both Roman-Catholic-
--       mandatory-clerical-celibacy AND Reformation marriage-only-with-
--       no-celibate-option over-correction); Tanakh-anchor at Isaiah
--       56:3-5''s *eunuchs that keep my sabbaths* (the scattered-seed
--       coming-home substance per Red Line #11).
--   (c) the little-children-brought-to-the-King + the disciples''-
--       rebuke-rebuked (vv.13-15) — the disciples'' *epetimēsan*
--       (rebuked) the children-bringers, the same substance Kefa
--       (Peter) operated in at Matthew 16:22 rebuking-the-King over
--       the first passion-prediction, the same disposition the King
--       had-just-corrected at Matthew 18:1-5; *suffer little children,
--       and forbid them not, to come unto me: for of such is the
--       kingdom of heaven* restates the matt-18:1-5 substance at the
--       practical-substance level — the kingdom belongs to those-who-
--       bear-the-four-fold-child-substance (humility, receptiveness,
--       dependence, honesty), NOT original-innocence-by-default per
--       the institutional-Christian-tradition''s collapse; the King''s-
--       laying-on-of-hands is the Tanakh-paternal-blessing substance
--       of Genesis 48''s Ya''aqov (Jacob)-blessing-the-sons-of-Yoseph
--       (Joseph) + Numbers 6:24-26''s priestly-blessing enacted by the
--       King-himself.
--   (d) the rich-young-ruler + camel-eye-of-needle + with-Elohim
--       (God)-all-things-are-possible (vv.16-26) — the young-man''s
--       *what good thing shall I do, that I may have eternal life?* +
--       the King''s *why callest thou me good? there is none good but
--       one, that is, Elohim (God)* probe (Formless-Father / Formed-
--       Son architecture pressing the young-man''s naming-the-King-
--       good) + the FRAMEWORK-MAJOR *if thou wilt enter into life,
--       keep the commandments* (v.17) at the kingdom-entry-criterion-
--       level — DIRECT load-bearing scripture-anchor against Red Line
--       #2''s antinomian-Paul reading, in continuity with Matthew
--       5:17-19, Matthew 7:21-23''s *I never knew you: depart from me,
--       ye that work iniquity (anomia)*, Matthew 22:36-40, 1 Yochanan
--       (John) 2:3-4 the 1234 of Truth, Revelation 14:12 + 22:14;
--       Tanakh-substance at Deuteronomy 30:15-20''s *choose life... keep
--       his commandments*, Leviticus 18:5''s *which if a man do, he
--       shall live in them*, Proverbs 4:13; the King''s-selection of
--       five-of-the-Ten plus Leviticus 19:18''s *love thy neighbour as
--       thyself* (the second-table-toward-the-neighbor substance); the
--       young-man''s *all these things have I kept from my youth up*
--       names letter-keeping without the heart-Torah-substance of
--       Jeremiah 31:33 / Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 36:26-27 per Matthew
--       5:20-48; *if thou wilt be perfect, go and sell that thou hast,
--       and give to the poor* (v.21) — Greek *teleios* is Tanakh-
--       *tamim* of Genesis 17:1, Deuteronomy 18:13, Matthew 5:48; the
--       test is diagnostic-not-categorical (different kingdom-citizens
--       face different obstacles; the substance is heart-Torah-
--       diagnostic, NOT universal-poverty-mandate, NOT Marxist-
--       redistribution); the young-man''s love-of-neighbor stopped at
--       the substance of his own possessions, the love-that-does-not-
--       extend-to-the-poor-who-could-be-fed against Tanakh-substance
--       of Deuteronomy 15:7-8, Proverbs 19:17, Psalm 41:1, Isaiah
--       58:6-7; the *went away sorrowful* heart-substance is open-
--       substance for the return (Mark 10:21''s *Yahusha (Jesus)
--       beholding him loved him*); the camel-through-eye-of-needle is
--       straight Tanakh-hyperbole-pattern (NOT the Needle''s-Eye-gate
--       explanation that has no historical-evidence), the substance of
--       impossibility-deliberately-stated under the Tanakh-prophetic
--       substance against trusting-in-riches at Proverbs 30:7-9,
--       Jeremiah 9:23-24, Deuteronomy 8:11-14, Psalm 49:6-7, Psalm
--       62:10; *with men this is impossible; but with Elohim (God) all
--       things are possible* (v.26) lands the Father''s-substance
--       making-the-impossible-possible at Genesis 18:14, Jeremiah
--       32:17, 27, Job 42:2, Luke 1:37 — bounded by the new-heart-
--       substance of Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 36:26-27 the Father''s-
--       substance enables, NOT universalist-determinism overriding the
--       cause-and-effect-of-walking the kingdom-citizen-substance.
--   (e) Kefa (Peter)''s-question + the FRAMEWORK-MAJOR Matt 19:28
--       twelve-thrones-judging-the-twelve-tribes statement + the
--       hundredfold-and-everlasting-life + the *many that are first
--       shall be last* bridge to Matt 20 (vv.27-30) — Kefa (Peter)''s
--       *we have forsaken all, and followed thee; what shall we have
--       therefore?* apostolic-substance asking-the-King the substance
--       of the discipleship-following; *in the regeneration when the
--       Son of Adam shall sit in the throne of his glory, ye also
--       shall sit upon twelve thrones, judging the twelve tribes of
--       Yashar''el (Israel)* is the King''s-mouth most-direct-statement
--       of the consummated-kingdom-architecture the framework''s-thesis
--       carries; Greek *palingenesia* (*regeneration, re-genesis*) is
--       the new-heavens-and-new-earth substance of Isaiah 65:17 + 66:22
--       + Acts 3:21''s *apokatastasis* (*restoration*) + Romans
--       8:18-25''s cosmic-renewal-substance; the *Son of Adam shall sit
--       in the throne of his glory* substance is the Daniel 7:13-14
--       *one like the Son of Adam* (kaph-comparative incarnation-
--       honoring per Red Line #12) restated at Matthew 25:31 sheep-
--       and-goats substance; the *twelve thrones... judging the twelve
--       tribes of Yashar''el (Israel)* is the FRAMEWORK-MAJOR-anchor
--       for the twelve-tribes-restoration-architecture per Red Line
--       #11 — the twelve-apostles named-from-the-twelve-tribes-
--       substance at Matthew 10:2-4 are seated in the consummated-
--       kingdom as-judges-of-the-twelve-tribes-of-Yashar''el (Israel),
--       in continuity with Ezekiel 37:21-22''s two-sticks-becoming-one,
--       Isaiah 11:11-12''s *outcasts of Yashar''el (Israel)... dispersed
--       of Yahudah (Judah)*, Jeremiah 31:31''s new-covenant-with-both-
--       houses, Ezekiel 47-48''s twelve-tribes-land-allotment, and
--       Revelation 21:12-14''s twelve-gates-named-for-the-twelve-tribes
--       + twelve-foundations-named-for-the-twelve-apostles; rules out
--       BOTH the institutional-Christian replacement-theology-substance
--       (church-as-spiritual-Israel collapse) AND the Hebrew-Roots
--       false-inclusion-gospel (anyone-who-believes-and-Torah-keeps-is-
--       therefore-Yashar'el (Israel) collapse); the wild-olive-branches
--       at Romans 11 are the scattered-seed-living-as-goyim (Gentiles)-
--       among-the-nations coming home, BOTH branches on the olive-tree
--       are Yashar'el (Israel); the *every one that hath forsaken
--       houses... shall receive an hundredfold, and shall inherit
--       everlasting life* extends from the apostolic-twelve to all-
--       kingdom-citizens, with the Markan-parallel Mark 10:29-30''s
--       *now in this time, houses, and brethren, and sisters, and
--       mothers, and children, and lands, with persecutions; and in
--       the world to come eternal life* the kingdom-family-substance
--       multiplied-now in the corporate-substance (Matthew 12:46-50,
--       Acts 2:44-45, Acts 4:32-37); the *many that are first shall be
--       last; and the last shall be first* bridges directly to Matthew
--       20:1-16''s laborers-in-the-vineyard parable.
--
-- Matt 19 reading-target: the chapter walks five movements with the
-- Tanakh-substance carrying the heaviest framework-bearing anchors
-- directly. The extras-library adds five framework-bearing thread-
-- clusters:
--   Thread 1: Jubilees 3 + Tobit 8 + Wisdom of Solomon 3 on the
--     creation-ordinance marriage + the blessed-eunuch-with-inheritance
--     substance — the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of Bereshit
--     (Genesis) 1-2''s creation-ordinance the King appeals-behind-
--     Mosheh to at vv.4-6, and of the eunuch-with-an-inheritance the
--     Isaiah 56:3-5 substance carries forward to the King''s-eunuchs-
--     for-the-kingdom-of-heaven''s-sake saying at v.12.
--   Thread 2: Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 7 + 3 + Tobit 4 on the
--     children-and-parental-instruction substance — the wisdom-stream''s
--     direct articulation of receiving-children-as-blessing and the
--     covenant-transmission-substance the King''s little-children-to-
--     the-King substance at vv.13-15 walks at the practical-substance
--     level.
--   Thread 3 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 17 + 29 +
--     Tobit 4 + Testaments of Levi 7 on the keep-the-commandments-as-
--     life + lay-up-treasure-in-heaven substance — DIRECT load-bearing
--     wisdom-stream anchor against Red Line #2''s antinomian-Paul
--     reading, with Test XII Levi 7 the precise verbal-anchor (*work
--     righteousness, that ye may have it as a treasure in heaven*) the
--     King restates at v.21''s *thou shalt have treasure in heaven.*
--   Thread 4: 1 Enoch 94-100 on the woes-against-the-rich + riches-
--     shall-not-be-able-to-save substance — the Enochic wisdom-stream''s
--     extended-woes-against-trust-in-wealth tying directly to the
--     camel-through-the-eye-of-a-needle Tanakh-hyperbole at vv.23-24
--     AND to the disciples'' *who then can be saved?* substance at v.25
--     (1 Enoch 100:6''s *recognize that their riches shall not be able
--     to save them*).
--   Thread 5 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): Jubilees 1 + 31 + Sirach
--     (Ecclesiasticus) 36 + Wisdom of Solomon 3 + Testaments XII Joseph
--     15 on the gathering-of-the-twelve-tribes + the thrones-of-
--     judgment substance — the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of
--     the twelve-tribes-restoration architecture the King''s-mouth at
--     Matt 19:28 states most-explicitly, with Sirach 36:11''s *gather
--     all the tribes of Jacob together* and Jubilees 31:15''s *princes
--     and judges, and chiefs of all the seed of the sons of Jacob...
--     they will judge all His judgments in righteousness* the precise
--     verbal-anchors per Red Line #11''s twelve-tribe-gathering
--     architecture.
--
-- Apocrypha-Charles-vol1 scholarly-parallels do not surface separately
-- here (the main apocrypha-edition carries Sirach + Tobit + Wisdom of
-- Solomon directly). Jasher, Adam-Eve Conflict, Apocalypse of Abraham,
-- 2 Enoch, 2 Baruch, 3 Baruch, 4 Maccabees, and Sonnini''s Acts of Paul
-- do not surface framework-bearing Matt 19 connections at S155 that
-- exceed the five threads above. Historical-witness editions (Josephus,
-- M.R. James''s apocryphal NT, Lightfoot''s Apostolic Fathers) remain
-- deferred from V1 per the historical-witness one-way rule. The lookup
-- view retains the S154 edition set for forward compatibility.
--
-- Five PROPOSED threads at extras-tier:
--   1. `creation-ordinance-marriage-and-the-blessed-eunuch-in-jubilees-tobit-and-wisdom-of-solomon`           (sort 317)
--   2. `receiving-the-children-and-parental-instruction-in-sirach-and-tobit`                                  (sort 318)
--   3. `keep-the-commandments-as-life-and-lay-up-treasure-in-heaven-in-sirach-tobit-and-testaments-of-levi`   (sort 319)
--   4. `woes-on-the-rich-and-riches-cannot-save-in-1-enoch`                                                   (sort 320)
--   5. `the-gathering-of-the-twelve-tribes-and-the-thrones-of-judgment-in-jubilees-sirach-wisdom-and-testaments-xii` (sort 321)
--
-- 22 new cross_references rows at tier_required=''extras'' (Library
-- tier, $4.99) + 5 new cross_reference_threads at tier_required=
-- ''complete_study'' (Companion tier, $9.99). The tier split honors the
-- chapter-end-card architecture established at S146 and prior: Layer 1
-- (per-verse cross-refs) visible to Library readers; Layer 2 (framework
-- thread callouts with summary_md + member_notes) gated at Companion.
-- Every member-note passes the 12 Red Lines and the 12-point editorial
-- checklist. The seed-mechanism per framework-deep''s *Paternal Seed
-- and the Marriage-Covenant Absorption* section + Red Line #7
-- augmentation does not surface within Matt 19 (no foreign-origin
-- individuals in the chapter''s narrative — the chapter is internal to
-- the disciples, the Pharisees, the little-children-brought-with-the-
-- parents, the rich-young-ruler, and the broader-multitudes-following,
-- all within-the-covenant-people the King addresses); the twelve-tribe-
-- gathering architecture surfaces directly at vv.27-30 and is governed
-- by Red Line #11 throughout.
-- Hebrew names with internal apostrophes (Yashar''el, Ya''aqov, Yechezk''el,
-- Yo''el, Sha''ul, Mikha''el, Mosheh''s, King''s, Father''s, Yahuah''s,
-- Yochanan''s, Kefa''s, etc.) and English possessives (wisdom-stream''s,
-- master''s, Father''s, King''s, system''s, etc.) are escaped per SQL
-- single-quoted-string-literal convention (every internal ' doubled to '').
--
-- Idempotent: ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING on every INSERT.
-- =====================================================================

\echo 'Session 155 — Matt 19 extras-tier cross-references migration starting...'
BEGIN;

-- Verse-lookup temp view. Mirrors the S154 view; retained for forward
-- compatibility.
CREATE TEMP VIEW _s155_xref_lookup AS
SELECT
    e.slug AS edition_slug,
    b.slug AS book_slug,
    c.chapter_number,
    v.verse_number,
    v.id AS verse_id
  FROM verses v
  JOIN chapters c ON v.chapter_id = c.id
  JOIN books    b ON c.book_id    = b.id
  JOIN editions e ON b.edition_id = e.id
 WHERE e.slug IN (
       'canon',
       'enoch',
       'jubilees',
       'jasher',
       'apocrypha',
       'apocrypha-charles-vol1',
       'pseudepigrapha',
       'adam-eve-conflict',
       'apocalypse-of-abraham',
       'ascension-isaiah',
       'sonnini-acts-29'
   );

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Insert 22 extras-tier cross_references rows (5 threads; 4 + 3 + 5 + 5 + 5 members).
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
WITH input(src_edition, src_slug, src_ch, src_v,
           tgt_edition, tgt_slug, tgt_ch, tgt_v, note) AS (VALUES

  -- Thread 1: creation-ordinance-marriage-and-the-blessed-eunuch-in-jubilees-tobit-and-wisdom-of-solomon
  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 4, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 3, 4,
   '*And Yahuah (God) said to us: "It is not good that the man should be alone: let us make a helpmeet for him."* Jubilees 3:4 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the creation-ordinance substance Bereshit (Genesis) 2:18 names — the same substance the King appeals-behind-Mosheh (Moses) to at Matt 19:4''s *have ye not read, that he which made them at the beginning made them male and female.* The framework reads the verse against the architectural-pattern the King''s-method establishes — the Father''s-will-from-the-beginning is the substance-of-reference; the Mosaic-Deuteronomy 24:1-permission is concession-to-hardness-of-heart; both substances Torah-preserved, neither abolishing the other. Jubilees 3 carries the creation-ordinance forward at the wisdom-stream-register exactly as Bereshit (Genesis) 1-2 carries it at the Torah-register — Yahuah (God) names the not-good-that-man-be-alone substance and forms the help-meet from the man''s-own-substance. The King''s-appeal-behind-Mosheh stands on the substance the Torah AND the wisdom-stream BOTH carry as Father''s-will-from-the-beginning.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 5, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 3, 6,
   '*And He awaked Adam out of his sleep and on awaking he rose on the sixth day, and He brought her to him, and he knew her, and said to her: "This is now bone of my bones and flesh of my flesh; she will be called my wife; because she was taken from her husband."* Jubilees 3:6 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the one-flesh-from-the-beginning substance — the same Bereshit (Genesis) 2:23-24 substance the King restates at Matt 19:5''s *for this cause shall a man leave father and mother, and shall cleave to his wife: and they twain shall be one flesh.* The framework reads the verse as the wisdom-stream''s direct corroboration that the one-flesh-substance is the Father''s-substance-from-the-beginning (Adam''s-naming-of-Eve as bone-of-my-bones-and-flesh-of-my-flesh, the man-and-woman-from-the-man''s-own-body substance per Red Line #11''s seed-and-marriage-covenant architecture in framework-deep''s *Paternal Seed and the Marriage-Covenant Absorption* section — the woman was-taken-from-the-man-himself, not from the goyim (nations)). The kingdom-citizen''s-marriage-substance walks-toward the Father''s-will-from-the-beginning the wisdom-stream had named at the substance-register Bereshit (Genesis) names at the Torah-register.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 6, 'apocrypha', 'tobit', 8, 6,
   '*You madest Adam, and gavest him Eve his wife for an helper and stay: of them came mankind: you have said, It is not good that man should be alone; let us make to him an aid like to himself.* Tobit 8:6 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the creation-ordinance marriage-substance in Tobias''s-prayer-at-the-marriage-bed — the same Bereshit (Genesis) 2:18 + 2:23-24 substance the King restates at Matt 19:6''s *wherefore they are no more twain, but one flesh. What therefore Elohim (God) hath joined together, let not man put asunder.* The framework reads the verse as the wisdom-stream''s direct anchor for the Father-joins-the-one-flesh-substance — Tobias prays the creation-ordinance substance over his marriage to Sarah, naming the same substance the King names at the divorce-controversy-pivot. The wisdom-stream and the gospel cohere at the Father-joins-the-one-flesh-substance architecture; what the Father has joined, no human authority undoes at preference. The substance is in continuity with Malachi 2:14-16''s *Yahuah Elohim (the LORD God) of Yashar''el (Israel)... hateth putting away* — the Father''s-substance toward-putting-away has-always-been-hate-substance, the Mosaic-concession-permission notwithstanding.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 12, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 3, 14,
   '*And blessed is the eunuch, which with his hands has wrought no iniquity, nor imagined wicked things against Yahuah (God): for to him shall be given the special gift of faith, and an inheritance in the temple of Yahuah (the LORD) more acceptable to his mind.* Wisdom of Solomon 3:14 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the blessed-eunuch-with-an-inheritance substance — the Isaiah 56:3-5 substance the King''s eunuchs-for-the-kingdom-of-heaven''s-sake saying at Matt 19:12 carries forward at the gospel-register. The framework reads the verse against the King''s *there be eunuchs, which have made themselves eunuchs for the kingdom of heaven''s sake. He that is able to receive it, let him receive it.* The Isaiah 56:3-5 promise — *a place and a name better than of sons and of daughters* in the Father''s-house — and the Wisdom of Solomon 3:14 promise — *the special gift of faith, and an inheritance in the temple of Yahuah (the LORD)* — both name the wisdom-stream-substance the voluntary-celibate-for-the-kingdom-of-heaven walks. The substance is gift, not mandate; the substance is the kingdom-citizen-receiving-the-substance, not the system imposing it. The framework rules out BOTH the Roman-Catholic-mandatory-clerical-celibacy substance the institutional-tradition has imposed AND the Reformation-marriage-mandate-with-no-honored-celibate-substance over-correction. The substance the King-himself walked (1 Corinthians 7:7-8, 32-35''s apostle Sha''ul (Paul) walking the same gift-substance) is the substance offered-to-those-to-whom-it-is-given, with the wisdom-stream''s-promise-of-inheritance the Isaiah 56 substance carries.'),

  -- Thread 2: receiving-the-children-and-parental-instruction-in-sirach-and-tobit
  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 13, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 7, 23,
   '*Have you children? instruct them, and bow down their neck from their youth.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 7:23 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the parental-instruction-of-children substance — the substance the parents-bringing-the-little-children-to-the-King at Matt 19:13 enact at the practical-substance level. The framework reads the verse against Matt 19:13''s *then were there brought unto him little children, that he should put his hands on them, and pray.* The parents'' act is in continuity with the Tanakh-and-wisdom-stream-substance of bringing-children-to-the-Father-for-instruction-and-blessing — the parental-substance of transmitting-the-covenant-to-the-next-generation (Devarim (Deuteronomy) 6:6-7''s *and thou shalt teach them diligently unto thy children, and shalt talk of them when thou sittest in thine house*; Tehillim (Psalm) 78:5-7''s substance-of-teaching-the-children). The King-as-the-Father''s-substance-in-the-flesh receives-the-children the parents have brought to him; the wisdom-stream had named the substance the parents are walking-in.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 14, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 3, 1,
   '*Hear me your father, O children, and do thereafter, that you may be safe.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 3:1 names the wisdom-stream''s direct opening of the children-hearing-the-father substance — the kingdom-citizens'' child-substance-disposition the King names at Matt 19:14''s *suffer little children, and forbid them not, to come unto me: for of such is the kingdom of heaven.* The framework reads the verse against the four-fold-child-substance the King had unpacked at Matthew 18:1-5 — humility, receptiveness, dependence, honesty. The wisdom-stream-substance of children-hearing-the-father is the substance the kingdom-citizen-disposition walks-in: hearing the Father, doing thereafter. The framework reads in continuity with the cause-and-effect-of-hearing per Red Line #11 — *if you hear, you are sons of Avraham (Abraham); you are sons of Adam; you are the seed of promise.* Hearing reveals what was always true. The kingdom-citizens'' child-substance is the substance-that-hears the Father''s-substance when the Father''s-substance speaks. The framework reads this NOT as original-innocence-by-default per the institutional-Christian-tradition (which the Tanakh-and-the-King do not name) BUT as the disposition-substance the four-fold-child-substance carries.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 15, 'apocrypha', 'tobit', 4, 3,
   '*And when he had called him, he said, My son, when I am dead, bury me; and despise not your mother, but honour her all the days of your life, and do that which shall please her, and grieve her not.* Tobit 4:3 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the paternal-instruction-substance the substance of children-honoring-parents the Decalogue-fifth-commandment (Shemot (Exodus) 20:12, Devarim (Deuteronomy) 5:16) names. The framework reads the verse against Matt 19:15''s *and he laid his hands on them, and departed thence* — the King performs the substance the parents had brought their children for. The Tanakh-paternal-blessing-substance of Bereshit (Genesis) 48''s Ya''aqov (Jacob)-laying-hands-on-the-sons-of-Yoseph (Joseph) and the priestly-blessing-substance of Numbers 6:24-26 is the substance the King-enacts at the laying-on-of-hands. The Tobit-passage is the broader-context the substance the parental-instruction-substance walks in — the father-Tobit instructs his son Tobias in the substance of honoring-the-mother and walking-the-covenant-substance, and the substance is the substance the kingdom-citizen-disposition the King receives in the children-the-parents-bring carries forward.'),

  -- Thread 3: keep-the-commandments-as-life-and-lay-up-treasure-in-heaven-in-sirach-tobit-and-testaments-of-levi
  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 17, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 17, 11,
   '*Beside this he gave them knowledge, and the law of life for an heritage.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 17:11 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the law-of-life-as-heritage substance — the same substance the King names at Matt 19:17''s *if thou wilt enter into life, keep the commandments.* The framework reads the verse against the King''s-own-mouth-at-the-kingdom-entry-criterion-level. Sirach 17:11-12''s extended-context names the substance directly: *he gave them knowledge, and the law of life for an heritage. He made an everlasting covenant with them, and shewed them his judgments.* The wisdom-stream-substance carries forward the Tanakh-substance of Devarim (Deuteronomy) 30:15-20''s *I have set before thee this day life and good... keep his commandments* and Vayikra (Leviticus) 18:5''s *which if a man do, he shall live in them.* The King at Matt 19:17 stands on the substance the wisdom-stream had named the law-of-life-as-heritage architecture for. The framework reads this as the wisdom-stream-substance the FRAMEWORK-MAJOR-LOADING moment against Red Line #2''s antinomian-Paul reading lands on — the substance is direct, load-bearing, and continuous across the Tanakh, the wisdom-stream, the King''s-mouth, and the apostolic-restatement at 1 Yochanan (John) 2:3-4''s 1234 of Truth.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 17, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 29, 1,
   '*He that is merciful will lend to his neighbour; and he that strengtheneth his hand keepeth the commandments.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 29:1 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the love-of-neighbor-substance the King will-test-the-young-man at — the same substance the King ties to the kingdom-entry-criterion at Matt 19:17 (*keep the commandments*) and to the rich-young-ruler''s-failure-test at v.21 (*go and sell that thou hast, and give to the poor*). The framework reads the verse against the integrated-substance the King''s-test-of-the-young-man walks: the mercy-to-the-neighbor IS the commandment-keeping; the substance is not separable. The wisdom-stream-substance names the architecture directly — *he that is merciful will lend... keepeth the commandments.* The young-man''s *all these things have I kept from my youth up* at v.20 names letter-keeping; the diagnostic-test at v.21 reveals the heart-Torah-substance the young-man has-not-walked. The framework reads in continuity with Vayikra (Leviticus) 19:18''s *love thy neighbour as thyself* the King-summary-cites at v.19. The wisdom-stream had named the substance integrated; the inherited-institutional-Christian-tradition has often separated mercy-from-Torah; the wisdom-stream-substance and the King''s-substance both hold the substances together as one motion.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 21, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 29, 11,
   '*Lay up your treasure according to the commandments of the Most High, and it shall bring you more profit than gold.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 29:11 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the lay-up-treasure-according-to-the-commandments substance — the same substance the King names at Matt 19:21''s *go and sell that thou hast, and give to the poor, and thou shalt have treasure in heaven: and come and follow me.* The framework reads the verse as the wisdom-stream''s direct verbal-prefiguration of the King''s-substance. The King''s-test of the young-man is heart-Torah-diagnostic — different-kingdom-citizens face different-substances-of-obstacle; the rich-young-ruler faces the substance-of-substantial-possessions; the test reveals the love-of-neighbor stopped-at-the-substance-of-the-young-man''s-own-possessions. The wisdom-stream-substance had named the architecture — laying-up-treasure-according-to-the-commandments-of-the-Most-High is the substance the kingdom-citizens'' substance-of-possessions walks toward. The framework rules out the inherited-Christian-substance-misreadings: NOT universal-poverty-mandate for-all-kingdom-citizens; NOT Marxist-redistribution at-the-political-substance-level. The substance is heart-Torah-diagnostic; the substance is laying-up-treasure-according-to-the-commandments, which-includes-the-giving-to-the-poor-the-Torah-has-always-commanded (Devarim (Deuteronomy) 15:7-8, Mishlei (Proverbs) 19:17, Tehillim (Psalm) 41:1, Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 58:6-7).'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 21, 'apocrypha', 'tobit', 4, 9,
   '*For you layest up a good treasure for thyself against the day of necessity.* Tobit 4:9 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the laying-up-good-treasure substance — the substance Tobit-the-father-instructs his son Tobias to walk in the broader-Tobit-4:7-11 almsgiving-context (*give alms of your substance... if you have abundance give alms accordingly: if you have but a little, be not afraid to give according to that little*). The framework reads the verse against Matt 19:21''s *thou shalt have treasure in heaven.* The wisdom-stream-substance of laying-up-good-treasure-against-the-day-of-necessity through the substance-of-almsgiving-to-the-poor IS the substance the King-names at v.21. The substance is the Tanakh-substance-of-giving-to-the-poor (Devarim (Deuteronomy) 15:7-8, Mishlei (Proverbs) 19:17) carried-forward in the wisdom-stream as the substance-of-laying-up-treasure-against-the-day. The King''s-test of the rich-young-ruler reveals the substance the young-man could-not-walk — the laying-up-treasure-in-heaven through the substance of giving-to-the-poor. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture; the King applies the diagnostic at v.21.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 21, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 18, 5,
   '*Work righteousness, therefore, my children, upon the earth, that ye may have it as a treasure in heaven.* Testaments XII Levi 7 (chapter 18 in the corpus enumeration) verse 5 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the *treasure in heaven* substance — the exact phrase the King restates at Matt 19:21''s *thou shalt have treasure in heaven: and come and follow me.* The framework reads this as the wisdom-stream''s most-direct verbal-prefiguration of the King''s-substance. The Levi-testament-substance had named the architecture: *work righteousness... that ye may have it as a treasure in heaven.* The kingdom-citizens'' substance is righteousness-walked-on-the-earth that-translates-into-treasure-in-heaven; the substance is in continuity with the apostolic-restatement at 1 Timothy 6:18-19''s *that they do good, that they be rich in good works, ready to distribute, willing to communicate; laying up in store for themselves a good foundation against the time to come.* The King at Matt 19:21 stands on the wisdom-stream-substance the Test XII Levi 7 had named. The framework reads this in continuity with the FRAMEWORK-MAJOR substance the King ties to the kingdom-entry-criterion at v.17 — *keep the commandments* — and the diagnostic-test at v.21 the heart-Torah-substance lands on. The wisdom-stream, the King, and the apostle all hold the same substance: righteousness-walked + treasure-in-heaven are one architecture.'),

  -- Thread 4: woes-on-the-rich-and-riches-cannot-save-in-1-enoch
  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 23, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 94, 3,
   '*Woe to you who are rich! For you have trusted in your riches, And from your riches shall you depart, Because you have not remembered Yahuah (God) of Spirits in the days of your riches.* 1 Enoch 94:3 names THE direct Enochic wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the woe-against-trust-in-riches substance — the same substance the King names at Matt 19:23''s *verily I say unto you, That a rich man shall hardly enter into the kingdom of heaven.* The framework reads the verse against the King''s-warning. The Enochic-substance had named the architecture-directly: the rich-man''s-substance of trusting-in-riches operates against-the-remembering-Yahuah (God)-of-Spirits substance the kingdom-citizen-substance walks. The substance is heart-substance — *where your treasure is, there will your heart be also* per Matt 6:21''s Sermon-substance. The Enochic-woes-against-the-rich extended-corpus across 1 Enoch 94-100 unfolds the substance the King-summarizes at Matt 19:23-24. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture-in-extended-form; the King applies the substance at the camel-eye-of-needle-pivot.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 23, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 97, 7,
   '*Woe to you who acquire gold and silver in unrighteousness And say: "We have become rich with riches and have possessions; And we have acquired everything that we have desired."* 1 Enoch 97:7 names the Enochic wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the substance-of-the-rich-man''s-self-congratulation — the substance the rich-young-ruler''s *all these things have I kept from my youth up* at Matt 19:20 carries-by-implication-of-the-young-man''s-claim-to-have-acquired-everything-the-young-man-has-desired. The framework reads the verse against Matt 19:23''s warning about the rich man''s difficulty-entering-the-kingdom. The Enochic-substance names the architecture-of-the-acquired-everything-we-have-desired substance the rich-man-walks-in — the substance the rich-young-ruler had-walked-out at v.22 (the *went away sorrowful: for he had great possessions* substance reveals the heart-the-possessions-hold). The wisdom-stream had named the substance the kingdom-citizens'' substance contrasts with — the substance of the Father-as-the-treasure (Mishlei (Proverbs) 30:8-9, Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 9:23-24).'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 24, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 94, 8,
   '*And now let us do what we purposed: For we have gathered silver, And many are the husbandmen in our houses.* 1 Enoch 94:8 names the Enochic wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the rich-man''s-internal-monologue — the *let us do what we purposed* substance that-presupposes the gathered-silver and the many-husbandmen as-the-foundation-for-doing-what-the-rich-man-has-purposed. The framework reads the verse against Matt 19:24''s camel-through-the-eye-of-a-needle hyperbole — the impossibility-deliberately-stated. The Enochic-substance names the substance directly — the rich-man-presumes-on-his-resources to-do-what-he-has-purposed (the substance the King-will-name explicitly in the rich-fool parable at Luke 12:16-21''s *I will pull down my barns, and build greater; and there will I bestow all my fruits and my goods*). The substance the rich-man-presumes-on is the substance-that-cannot-fit through-the-eye-of-the-needle. The wisdom-stream and the gospel cohere at the architecture — the substance-the-rich-man-presumes-on against-the-substance-the-Father-actually-provides.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 25, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 98, 10,
   '*And now, know ye that ye are prepared for the day of destruction: Wherefore do not hope to live, ye sinners, but ye shall depart and die; For ye know no ransom; for ye are prepared for the day of the great judgement.* 1 Enoch 98:10 names the Enochic wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the *ye know no ransom* substance — the substance the disciples'' *who then can be saved?* at Matt 19:25 presupposes-the-failure-of. The framework reads the verse against the disciples'' question. The Enochic-substance names the substance directly: the rich-sinner-substance-presumes-on-the-substance-of-riches-as-ransom; the substance is failed-substance — *ye know no ransom.* The disciples'' question at v.25 — *who then can be saved?* — presupposes the inherited-substance that-had-associated-material-prosperity-with-the-Father''s-blessing (Bereshit (Genesis) 13:2, 26:12, Devarim (Deuteronomy) 28''s covenant-blessings); if-even-the-substance-the-Tanakh-treats-as-blessing is-an-obstacle, who-can-be-saved? The Enochic-substance had named the architecture-of-the-failure-of-the-rich-man''s-ransom; the King''s-substance at v.26 will-name the substance the Father makes-possible against-the-substance the natural-substance-finds-impossible.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 26, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 100, 6,
   '*And (then) the children of the earth shall see the wise in security, And shall understand all the words of this book, And recognize that their riches shall not be able to save them In the overthrow of their unrighteousness.* 1 Enoch 100:6 names THE direct Enochic wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the *riches shall not be able to save them* substance — the substance the King names at Matt 19:26''s *with men this is impossible; but with Elohim (God) all things are possible.* The framework reads the verse against the King''s-statement. The Enochic-substance names the architecture directly: the rich-substance cannot-save; the natural-substance cannot-accomplish the kingdom-entry-substance. The King''s-substance at v.26 lands the substance the Father makes-possible — the new-heart-substance of Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 36:26-27''s *a new heart also will I give you... I will put my spirit within you, and cause you to walk in my statutes.* The Father''s-substance is the substance that-softens-the-heart-the-possessions-hold and-enables-the-substance the natural-substance-cannot-walk. The framework rules out the universalist-reading the substance does NOT support — the substance is NOT that all-rich-men-will-be-saved regardless-of-disposition; the substance is that the Father''s-substance is-able-to-soften the substance the natural-substance-finds-impossible per Ezekiel 36:26-27 + Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 31:33''s heart-Torah architecture. Grace is the door-home, the means-of-return-to-the-Father''s-Way, NOT the cancellation-of-the-substance-the-Father-commands per the *Grace, the Way, the New Heart, and the Mercy of Depart* section of framework-deep.md.'),

  -- Thread 5: the-gathering-of-the-twelve-tribes-and-the-thrones-of-judgment-in-jubilees-sirach-wisdom-and-testaments-xii
  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 28, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 1, 15,
   '*And after this they will turn to Me from amongst the nations with all their heart and with all their soul and with all their strength, and I shall gather them from amongst all the nations, and they will seek me, so that I shall be found of them, when they seek me with all their heart and with all their soul.* Jubilees 1:15 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the gathering-from-amongst-all-the-nations substance — the same substance the King''s-mouth at Matt 19:28''s *in the regeneration when the Son of Adam shall sit in the throne of his glory, ye also shall sit upon twelve thrones, judging the twelve tribes of Yashar''el (Israel)* presupposes-as-the-completed-gathering-architecture. The framework reads the verse against the King''s-statement. The Jubilees-substance had named the architecture-directly at the wisdom-stream-register: the scattered-people turn-from-amongst-the-nations to-the-Father, and-the-Father-gathers-them-from-amongst-all-the-nations. The substance is in continuity with the Tanakh-prophetic-substance of Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 37:21-22''s two-sticks-becoming-one + Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 11:11-12''s *outcasts of Yashar''el (Israel)... dispersed of Yahudah (Judah) from the four corners of the earth* + Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 31:31''s new-covenant-with-both-houses. The wisdom-stream-substance and the prophetic-substance both name the gathering-architecture the King''s-Matt-19:28-statement carries-forward at the consummated-kingdom-substance. The framework reads in framework-substance per Red Line #11 — the twelve-tribes of Yashar''el (Israel) at the regeneration are the paternal-blood remnant the prophet-substance has-promised, NOT the spiritualized-church-as-spiritual-Yashar''el (Israel) collapse the institutional-Christian-tradition has built, NOT the Hebrew-Roots-false-inclusion-gospel''s self-selected-spiritual-substance. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 28, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 31, 15,
   '*And they will be princes and judges, and chiefs of all the seed of the sons of Jacob; They will speak the word of Yahuah (God) in righteousness, And they will judge all His judgments in righteousness.* Jubilees 31:15 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the princes-and-judges-of-all-the-seed-of-the-sons-of-Jacob substance — the same substance the King at Matt 19:28 carries forward in *ye also shall sit upon twelve thrones, judging the twelve tribes of Yashar''el (Israel).* The framework reads the verse against the King''s-statement. The Jubilees-substance is the patriarchal-blessing of Yitschaq (Isaac) on Levi at the Bethel-pilgrimage, naming the substance of the Levitical-priestly-line as princes-and-judges-and-chiefs-of-all-the-seed-of-the-sons-of-Jacob who-will-judge-all-His-judgments-in-righteousness. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture at the Levi-Yahudah (Judah)-pivot of the patriarchal-substance; the King''s-Matt-19:28-substance carries-the-architecture-forward to the apostolic-twelve seated-on-twelve-thrones at the consummated-kingdom. The Greek *krinontes* (*judging*) at Matt 19:28 is the same governance-substance Jubilees 31:15 names — the Tanakh-Shofetim (Judges)-substance of ruling-as-deliverers-of-Yashar''el (Israel) (Judges 2:16''s *Yahuah (the LORD) raised up judges, which delivered them*), carried-forward to the apostolic-substance at the consummated-substance under the King-on-the-throne-of-glory. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 28, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 36, 11,
   '*Gather all the tribes of Jacob together, and inherit you them, as from the beginning.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 36:11 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the gather-all-the-tribes-of-Jacob-together substance — the prayer the wisdom-stream offers-to-the-Father directly invoking the substance the King''s-mouth at Matt 19:28 states-as-completed-in-the-regeneration. The framework reads the verse against the King''s-statement. The Sirach 36 extended-context is a prayer for-the-redemption-and-gathering-of-Yashar''el (Israel) — *gather all the tribes of Jacob together, and inherit you them, as from the beginning. O Yahuah (God), have mercy upon the people that is called by your name, and upon Yashar''el (Israel), whom you have named your firstborn. O be merciful to Jerusalem, your holy city, the place of your rest.* The wisdom-stream-substance is the prayer-for-the-gathering the prophets had named the substance for; the King''s-Matt-19:28-substance is the statement-of-the-gathering completed at the consummated-kingdom. The framework reads in framework-substance per Red Line #11 — the gathering is the gathering of the literal-twelve-tribes, the paternal-blood remnant, *as from the beginning* (the substance Sirach names is the same architecture the prophets named — the inheritance is restored, the gathering completed, the twelve-tribes seated as Yahuah (the LORD)''s-firstborn).'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 28, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 3, 8,
   '*They shall judge the nations, and have dominion over the people, and their Elohim (God) shall reign for ever.* Wisdom of Solomon 3:8 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the judging-the-nations + dominion-over-the-people substance the souls-of-the-righteous-in-the-hand-of-Yahuah (God) at the consummated-substance walk-in. The framework reads the verse against Matt 19:28''s *ye also shall sit upon twelve thrones, judging the twelve tribes of Yashar''el (Israel).* The framework reads the substance carefully — the Wisdom of Solomon-substance names judging-the-nations at the consummated-substance; the King''s-Matt-19:28-substance names judging-the-twelve-tribes-of-Yashar''el (Israel) at the consummated-substance. The substances are the consummated-kingdom-architecture viewed-from-the-two-sides: the gathered-twelve-tribes-of-Yashar''el (Israel) sit-under-the-apostolic-thrones in the kingdom-of-priests architecture (Shemot (Exodus) 19:6, Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 61:6, Revelation 1:6, 5:10); the nations-left-alive-after-the-day-of-Yahuah (the LORD) receive priestly-instruction from the gathered-remnant. The framework reads in framework-substance per Red Line #11 — the destination of the gathering is a kingdom-of-priests for the nations-left-alive; the priestly-substance toward-the-nations begins at the consummated-kingdom, not before. The wisdom-stream had named both substances; the King''s-substance lands the architecture at the King''s-own-mouth. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 19, 28, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 86, 2,
   '*There were twelve harts feeding: and the nine were (first) dispersed over all the earth, and likewise also the three.* Testaments XII Joseph 15 (chapter 86 in the corpus enumeration) verse 2 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the twelve-harts-feeding-then-dispersed substance — the same scattering-and-restoration-of-the-twelve-tribes architecture the King at Matt 19:28''s *judging the twelve tribes of Yashar''el (Israel)* presupposes-as-the-completed-gathering-architecture. The framework reads the verse against the King''s-statement. The Joseph-testament-substance names the substance directly: twelve-harts (the twelve-tribes) feeding-together-originally, then-dispersed (the nine = the ten-northern-tribes; the three = the southern-house-substance), the substance the prophets had named at Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 37:15-22''s two-sticks-becoming-one. The substance the King-states at Matt 19:28 is the gathering-and-judging-substance the wisdom-stream-Joseph-testament had named the architecture-for. The wisdom-stream, the Tanakh-prophets, and the King''s-mouth all hold the same architecture: twelve-tribes-dispersed-and-gathered-and-judged-by-twelve-apostles-at-the-consummated-substance. The framework reads in framework-substance per Red Line #11 — the twelve-tribes are LITERAL twelve-tribes, the paternal-blood remnant the Father-promised-through-the-prophets-and-now-states-at-the-King''s-mouth. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.')

)
INSERT INTO cross_references (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source, note, tier_required)
SELECT sv.verse_id, tv.verse_id, 'manual', i.note, 'extras'::content_tier
  FROM input i
  JOIN _s155_xref_lookup sv ON sv.edition_slug   = i.src_edition
                           AND sv.book_slug      = i.src_slug
                           AND sv.chapter_number = i.src_ch
                           AND sv.verse_number   = i.src_v
  JOIN _s155_xref_lookup tv ON tv.edition_slug   = i.tgt_edition
                           AND tv.book_slug      = i.tgt_slug
                           AND tv.chapter_number = i.tgt_ch
                           AND tv.verse_number   = i.tgt_v
 WHERE sv.verse_id <> tv.verse_id
ON CONFLICT (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source) DO NOTHING;

